      "steps": [
        {
          "number": 1,
          "id": "step-1",
          "heading": "Make the meatballs",
          "blocks": [
            "Heat the oven to 220°C (200°C fan, gas 7). Bring a large saucepan of water with {{pasta-salt}} salt to a boil for the rigatoni. Peel and grate or press the garlic.",
            "Mix the breadcrumbs with {{crumb-salt}} salt and {{crumb-water}} water, the mixed herbs and half the garlic. Add the mince, season with pepper and mix well. Roll into five even meatballs per serving."
          ],
          "notes": [],
          "timers": [],
          "image": {
            "id": "pork-polpette-rigatoni-1-sketch",
