          }
        },
        {
          "number": 2,
          "id": "step-2",
          "heading": "Bake and cook the pasta",
          "blocks": [
            "Spread the meatballs out on a baking tray. Bake on the top shelf for 12–15 minutes until browned and cooked through.",
            "Boil the rigatoni for 12 minutes until tender. Drain, return to the saucepan and toss with a little oil to prevent sticking."
          ],
          "notes": [],
